#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:5 96708c921dfb4c868a595e39afd9696e
msgid "QRTL Mode"
msgstr "QRTL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:7 0ec9e466728f4545b50de6ef56bc2599
msgid ""
"QRTL mode (QuadPlane Return To Launch mode) navigates QuadPlane from its "
"current position to hover above the home position and then land. The "
"behavior of QRTL mode can be controlled by several adjustable parameters. "
"This page describes how to use and customize QRTL mode."
msgstr ""
"QRTL 模式（QuadPlane 返回起飞点模式）引导 QuadPlane 从当前位置飞回 Home 点上空后降落。QRTL "
"模式的行为可通过多个可调参数控制。本页介绍如何使用和自定义 QRTL 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:13 504eb524cbd54f1cb0b9dbe77b0e0836
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:15 a7deed78fef947ad909b8f917caadc73
msgid ""
"When QRTL mode is selected, the QuadPlane will return to the home location. "
"By default, it will transition to fixed wing mode (if in a VTOL mode before "
"entering, it will climb to :ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` if below that "
"altitude, before transitioning), executing the first part of a normal RTL, "
"and then make an approach  as it nears the landing point and switch to VTOL "
"mode and proceed to the landing point, then descend to a landing. See the "
"description of this under the :ref:`Hybrid RTL<hybrid_rtl>` section for "
":ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3."
msgstr ""
"选择 QRTL 模式后，QuadPlane 将返回 Home 位置。默认情况下，它会切换到固定翼模式（如果在进入前处于 VTOL 模式，将先爬升至 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>`，再切换），执行普通 RTL 的第一段，然后在接近降落点时切换到 VTOL "
"模式并飞向降落点，最后下降着陆。相关说明详见 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3 时的 :ref:`混合 "
"RTL<hybrid_rtl>` 部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:17 7a2bca1f71ab46c1b199710e334637fb
msgid ""
"If a pure VTOL QRTL is desired, then you must disable the fixed wing RTL and"
" approach feature by setting :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` bit 16. Then the "
"following actions will then occur on a QRTL:"
msgstr ""
"若需要纯 VTOL 的 QRTL，则必须通过设置 :ref:`Q_OPTIONS<Q_OPTIONS>` 的第16位来禁用固定翼 RTL "
"和进近功能。此后 QRTL 将执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:19 fde1d59424df447abf9766a985b65cce
msgid ""
"The QuadPlane will immediately navigate towards the home location at "
":ref:`Q_WP_SPEED<Q_WP_SPEED>`, climbing or descending towards the "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` altitude. Once arriving within "
":ref:`Q_WP_RADIUS<Q_WP_RADIUS>` distance of home, it will begin descending "
"at :ref:`Q_WP_SPEED_DN<Q_WP_SPEED_DN>` rate, until it reaches "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` at which point it will descend at "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD<Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD>` until landing."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 将以 :ref:`Q_WP_SPEED<Q_WP_SPEED>` 立即导航至 Home 位置，同时爬升或下降至 "
":ref:`Q_RTL_ALT<Q_RTL_ALT>` 高度。到达距 Home :ref:`Q_WP_RADIUS<Q_WP_RADIUS>` "
"范围内后，以 :ref:`Q_WP_SPEED_DN<Q_WP_SPEED_DN>` 速率下降，直至达到 "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>`，然后以 "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD<Q_LAND_FINAL_SPD>` 速率继续下降直至落地。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:26 d625b3df59fe421c899e463d6a0bae5a
msgid ""
"QuadPlane will recognize that it has landed if the motors are at minimum for"
" 5 seconds and its altitude has not changed more than 0.2m for 4 seconds.  "
"It does not use the altitude itself to decide whether to shut off the motors"
" except that the QuadPlane must also be below "
":ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` above home(ie in the LAND FINAL "
"phase). The altitude change for the decision can be increased, in case the "
"altitude determination from the EKF is excessively noisy by increasing the "
":ref:`Q_LAND_ALTCHG<Q_LAND_ALTCHG>` value from its default value of 0.2m."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 会在电机保持最低转速5秒且高度变化不超过0.2m持续4秒时判定为已降落。它不会单独依赖高度本身来决定是否关闭电机，但 "
"QuadPlane 还必须位于 Home 点上方 :ref:`Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT<Q_LAND_FINAL_ALT>` 以下（即处于 "
"LAND FINAL 阶段）。若 EKF 的高度判断噪声过大，可通过增大 :ref:`Q_LAND_ALTCHG<Q_LAND_ALTCHG>` "
"的值（默认为0.2m）来提高用于判定的高度变化阈值。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:32 eda972c9227f4b12a69df6f76487759d
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you may :ref:`configure the plane to return to a Rally Point "
"<common-rally-points>`, rather than the home location."
msgstr "或者，您也可以 :ref:`将飞机配置为返回集结点 <common-rally-points>`，而非直接返回 Home 位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:36 8605a503e9aa4ec5b3791cc9a00ec174
msgid ""
"\"Home\" position is always supposed to be your Plane's actual GPS takeoff "
"location:"
msgstr "「Home」位置应始终是您的 Plane 实际 GPS 起飞位置："

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:39 5bc492712f244888b41615a54948f8de
msgid ""
"It is very important to acquire GPS lock before arming in order for QRTL, "
"QLOITER, AUTO or any GPS dependent mode to work properly. This requirement "
"is provided in  the default arming checks. It is highly recommended that "
"this check is not disabled."
msgstr ""
"在解锁前获得 GPS 锁定非常重要，这样 QRTL、QLOITER、AUTO 或其他依赖 GPS "
"的模式才能正常工作。此要求已包含在默认解锁检查中，强烈建议不要禁用此检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:41 201fb68126a34ebd86bf9b7e11f56447
msgid ""
"For QuadPlane the home position is initially established at the time the "
"plane acquires its GPS lock. It is then continuously updated as long as the "
"autopilot is disarmed."
msgstr "对于 QuadPlane，Home 位置最初在飞机获得 GPS 锁定时确定，此后在飞控处于上锁状态期间持续更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:45 13977399cbaf4822881f787855061053
msgid ""
"This means if you execute an QRTL in QuadPlane, it will return to the "
"location where it was when it was armed - assuming it had acquired GPS lock."
msgstr "这意味着，如果在 QuadPlane 中执行 QRTL，它将返回解锁时所在的位置——前提是已获得 GPS 锁定。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:48 b4e13f38bc2d4cdf83682813fecebfc4
msgid ""
"Consider the use of :ref:`Rally Points <common-rally-points>` to avoid "
"returning directly to your arming point on QRTL"
msgstr "建议使用 :ref:`集结点 <common-rally-points>` 以避免 QRTL 时直接返回解锁点。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:54 ac43bca7204f4e3891121acc0c73ee98
msgid ""
"In QRTL mode the autopilot uses a barometer which measures air pressure as "
"the primary means for determining altitude (\"Pressure Altitude\") and if "
"the air pressure is changing in your flight area, the copter will follow the"
" air pressure change rather than actual altitude."
msgstr ""
"在 QRTL 模式下，飞控使用气压计测量气压作为确定高度的主要方式（「气压高度」），若飞行区域气压发生变化，飞行器将跟随气压变化而非实际高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:62 e4253b811dad43a5928f58a913b78af7
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:65 e3cebcace3634b7090b9092edd8be56a
msgid ""
"Landing and re-arming the QuadPlane will reset home, which is a great "
"feature for flying at airfields."
msgstr "降落并重新解锁 QuadPlane 会重置 Home 位置，这对于在机场飞行非常实用。"

#: ../../source/docs/qrtl-mode.rst:67 3b88a902c76c456a84f40005406a7d06
msgid ""
"If you get lock for the first time while flying, your home will be set at "
"the location of lock."
msgstr "如果您在飞行中首次获得 GPS 锁定，Home 将被设置在锁定时的位置。"
